# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
package-lock.json
# ...except the browser test suite's. "npm ci" refuses to run without a
# lockfile, and a browser suite whose transitive dependencies can shift
# under it is exactly how a green suite becomes an intermittent one. The
# file never reaches a release archive: tests/playwright/ is export-ignore.
!tests/playwright/package-lock.json
# The E2E suite is installed with npm ci as well, which refuses to run
# without a lockfile.
!tests/e2e/package-lock.json
# The screen reader suite is installed with npm ci as well.
!tests/a11y-screenreader/package-lock.json
yarn.lock

